        "text": "In an increasingly multipolar and contested global order, \"Superficially, the World Bank and the IMF exhibit many common characteristics, yet...\" reflects India's calibrated transition from non-alignment to active multi-alignment and issue-based coalitions, safeguarding sovereign strategic autonomy (as articulated in Dr. S. Jaishankar's *The India Way*)."
